ht|n|at|^*GA1,1.  What to lead from two equivalent 4-card suits --  @DQJ62  @CAT62^*N|
                  
ht|o|at|^*GA2,2.  You generally do not want to lead suits that the opponents bid^*N|
                  
ht|p|at|^*GA3,3.  Bergen Hand Evaluation helped with good Auction^*N|
                  
ht|q|at|^*GA4,4.  The easiest way to play over a DONT double^*N|
                  
ht|r|at|^*GA5,5.  A complicated and informative Auction^*N|
                  
ht|s|at|^*GA6,6.  When you are responding to DONT and you have spades^*N|


