PG| ***** 1 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|East has two essentially equivalent 4 card suits--@DQJ62 @CAT62. In suit contract had East chosen to lead diamonds the @DQ, top of a sequence would be correct. However, in NT East only leads Queen from a 3-card sequence or broken sequence, QJ10 or QJ9. On this hand, a NT contract, had East chosen to lead a diamond, low from QJxx is correct.|
