mb|1D|mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|2C|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Now playing 2/1 game force, which I highly recommend and what we do at the table, when you have a 4 card major but 4 or more clubs, you bypass the major and bid 2@C to establish the game force. You can bid your major later.|
