mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Now I know we have a slam (assuming we are not missing 2 aces): but not sure if slam should be in NT or clubs. So 2N is fine since we are in G/F.|
