mb|P|mb|1N|mb|D|an|single suit|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|We play |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=dont,DONT^*N|CP||FP||at| on these sessions. When you are responding to |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=dont,DONT^*N|CP||FP||at| and you have spades, you can either double and bid 2@S or bid 2@S directly. If you bid 2@S, that tends to show a weak hand. If you double and bid 2@S, that shows a decent hand, an opener or so.|
