nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Or occasionally, as with West hand you can double and jump to 3@S. With any suit, if you double and jump to 3 in that suit, that shows a really good hand. So West playing |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=dont,DONT^*N|CP||FP||at|, doubling and jumping to 3@S is the best way to bid his hand.|
